    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24556" root="صقب" body-key="S">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صاقبهُ</span></b>  <i>He drew near to him:</i> and <i>he faced</i>

<i>him,</i> or <i>met him face to face:</i> (A:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاقَبَهُمْ</span>,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَاقَبَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِقَابٌ</span>, <i>he faced them,</i> or <i>met
them face to face:</i> (K:) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاقَبْنَاهُمْ</span>, inf. ns. as
above, <i>we drew near to them:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقِيتُهُ مُصَاقَبَةً</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِقَابًا</span> <i>I met him face to face.</i> (M.)

